<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανα-τρέχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run up to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.56
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς ὑψηλοτέρους τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λάρυγγος -τρέχοντος τῇ
					ἐπιγλωττίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.8
				</span></i>
			; of iron <i>approaching</i> a magnet, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταῖς
			οὐσίαις</span>, i.e. <i>become suddenly</i> rich, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run back, retrace past events</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραχὺ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.31.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῖς χρόνοις περί τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.12.8
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προανατρέχω</span>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
